  "description": "Aipas C2 Max Xpress Urban Commuter E-Bike\nThe Aipas C2 Max Xpress is designed for riders who want the perfect balance of power, comfort, and smart urban functionality. Whether you're commuting through busy city streets, running errands, or enjoying a casual ride, the C2 Max delivers smooth acceleration, efficient performance, and all-day riding comfort.\n\nBuilt for responsive acceleration and smooth throttle control—perfect for city hills, bridges, and stop-and-go traffic.\n\nRide farther with fewer charges—ideal for daily commutes and longer weekend trips.\n\n3. Smooth & Stable Ride\n\nEnjoy enhanced stability, traction, and shock absorption—even on rough or uneven roads. For extra comfort, pair it with a suspension seatpost.\n\n4. Safety & Visibility\n\nIntegrated brake light and rear light for increased visibility\n\nDesigned to keep you safe and visible in both day and night riding conditions.\n\nEffortlessly adapt to different terrains, traffic conditions, and riding styles.\n\nOptimized riding geometry reduces reach from seat to handlebar\n\nUpright riding position helps reduce fatigue on longer rides\n\n7. Built for Urban Life\nFrom daily commuting to errands and weekend cruising, the C2 Max Xpress is engineered to handle real-world city riding with ease, comfort, and reliability.\n\nCombined with a Shimano 7-speed system for a customizable and responsive riding experience.\n\n9. Modern & Eye-Catching Design\n\nPremium paint finish with metallic flakes creates a vibrant, eye-catching look in sunlight\n\n10. Easy Assembly\n\n90% pre-assembled (front wheel installed)\nQuick and beginner-friendly setup\n\nGet on the road in minutes with minimal effort.\n\nSummary\nThe Aipas C2 Max Xpress Urban Commuter E-Bike combines power, range, and comfort into one versatile package. Featuring an 1100W peak motor, 90 Nm of torque, and up to 85 miles of range, it’s built to tackle the demands of modern city riding.\nWith its durable frame, adjustable suspension, and rider-friendly geometry, the C2 Max is a reliable choice for commuters and casual riders alike.\nAdd essential accessories like a phone mount and bike lock for a smarter, safer, and more convenient ride.",
